WEBVTT

00:45.230 --> 00:48.900
<b>Kakeru Okikura</b>

01:08.380 --> 01:12.380
<b>Touko Fukami</b>

01:12.380 --> 01:15.880
<b>Yukinari Imi</b>

01:12.380 --> 01:15.880
<b>Hiro Shirosaki</b>

01:21.850 --> 01:25.850
<b>Yanagi Takayama</b>

01:31.730 --> 01:35.240
<b>Sachi Nagamiya</b>

01:54.250 --> 02:00.840
<b>Episode 1
"Fireworks"</b>

04:01.850 --> 04:02.970
<b>Nice!</b>

04:03.260 --> 04:04.990
<b>Wow.</b>

04:04.990 --> 04:06.870
<b>I take everything seriously.</b>

04:08.490 --> 04:09.460
<b>What's this?</b>

04:09.460 --> 04:10.980
<b>Huh? Show me.</b>

04:10.980 --> 04:13.940
<b>Oh, these things have 
gotten really advanced.</b>

04:13.940 --> 04:16.400
<b>They were so crummy when I was little.</b>

04:29.800 --> 04:31.220
<b>I've finally found you.</b>

04:32.850 --> 04:33.790
<b>What's wrong?</b>

04:34.730 --> 04:35.720
<b>Nothing.</b>

04:36.020 --> 04:38.870
<b>Do you think I can take it 
back to Sacchan as a gift?</b>

04:39.310 --> 04:40.390
<b>A bit much, don't you think?</b>

04:40.390 --> 04:42.040
<b>A bit.</b>

04:42.040 --> 04:44.020
<b>Like, I have—</b>

04:53.300 --> 04:54.730
<b>I'd like this one.</b>

05:53.600 --> 05:55.580
<b>Whoa, don't drop it.</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:57.630
<b>Trust me. I have good reflexes, Hiro.</b>

05:57.630 --> 05:59.970
<b>Fine,</b>

05:59.970 --> 06:02.800
<b>but you're paying for it if you break it.</b>

06:02.800 --> 06:06.840
<b>After all I went through to make 
sure we can split it completely evenly?</b>

06:25.460 --> 06:28.690
<b>I used to come here every day during 
my high school entrance exam days.</b>

06:28.690 --> 06:31.390
<b>Huh? Isn't this pretty far from your place?</b>

06:31.390 --> 06:34.080
<b>This kid gets pumped only when he's running.</b>

06:34.080 --> 06:35.620
<b>He could run forever.</b>

06:35.620 --> 06:37.000
<b>What do you mean, "only"?</b>

06:45.940 --> 06:47.920
<b>This is the last year we're 
all meeting up, huh?</b>

06:48.280 --> 06:48.910
<b>Huh?</b>

06:49.400 --> 06:51.640
<b>Why so negative?</b>

06:51.640 --> 06:53.810
<b>We could all come again.</b>

06:53.810 --> 06:56.160
<b>Yeah, next year, and the year after...</b>

06:56.160 --> 06:57.980
<b>We'll be friends forever!</b>

06:57.980 --> 07:01.270
<b>Forever? Who knows what'll 
happen in the future.</b>

07:01.510 --> 07:02.480
<b>What?</b>

07:02.480 --> 07:06.070
<b>So we're going to stop being 
friends once we graduate? Come on.</b>

07:06.510 --> 07:08.140
<b>No, but I mean,</b>

07:08.140 --> 07:10.280
<b>there's no telling what might happen.</b>

07:10.740 --> 07:13.790
<b>They say that if you say 
your wishes out loud,</b>

07:13.790 --> 07:15.320
<b>you'll end up granting them yourself.</b>

07:15.320 --> 07:19.200
<b>So maybe instead of saying "we won't come here," 
we should say "let's come again."</b>

07:19.200 --> 07:20.640
<b>Did you get that from Sachi?</b>

07:20.640 --> 07:22.150
<b>Yeah, so?</b>

07:22.450 --> 07:23.300
<b>Okay.</b>

07:25.040 --> 07:27.880
<b>My wish is that no matter what happens,</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:30.560
<b>my future self will fix it all.</b>

07:45.860 --> 07:46.920
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

07:46.920 --> 07:47.980
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:47.980 --> 07:49.710
<b>Two iced coffees.</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:50.550
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:50.550 --> 07:52.450
<b>Yukkii, give me a hand please.</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:53.260
<b>Okay.</b>

07:53.260 --> 07:55.750
<b>Since when is he "Yukkii"?</b>

07:56.050 --> 07:57.720
<b>They're totally best buds.</b>

07:57.720 --> 07:59.980
<b>More toast for the iced coffee customers.</b>

07:59.980 --> 08:01.760
<b>Such a salesman.</b>

08:01.760 --> 08:05.630
<b>Grandpa's so nice to Yukinari.</b>

08:06.120 --> 08:08.590
<b>You can hardly tell who's the grandson.</b>

08:08.880 --> 08:10.700
<b>Yuki-kun's popular.</b>

08:10.700 --> 08:12.470
<b>With the elderly.</b>

08:12.790 --> 08:14.370
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

08:14.370 --> 08:15.970
<b>What about Grandpa?</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:21.230
<b>Why is it so delicious when you eat out?</b>

08:21.480 --> 08:24.280
<b>I was going to stay away from ramune.</b>

08:24.280 --> 08:26.420
<b>Sucks to be watching your weight, huh?</b>

08:26.420 --> 08:28.210
<b>Please don't call it that.</b>

08:38.120 --> 08:39.620
<b>Here, look.</b>

08:41.660 --> 08:43.220
<b>It's sparkling.</b>

08:43.590 --> 08:45.770
<b>The fireworks were so pretty.</b>

08:45.770 --> 08:48.340
<b>Like, boom, bang!</b>

08:48.640 --> 08:51.340
<b>The festival's ending.</b>

08:51.340 --> 08:54.090
<b>Hinode
 Bridge</b>

08:54.260 --> 08:55.400
<b>I'm home.</b>

08:55.400 --> 08:56.340
<b>Welcome back.</b>

09:20.630 --> 09:21.370
<b>Welcome back.</b>

09:21.820 --> 09:23.040
<b>I'm home.</b>

09:23.040 --> 09:24.590
<b>What do you want for dinner?</b>

09:25.160 --> 09:26.100
<b>Stew.</b>

09:26.420 --> 09:27.950
<b>It's too hot, so no.</b>

09:27.950 --> 09:29.380
<b>What should I make?</b>

09:30.020 --> 09:32.730
<b>This again, Mom? 
Why do even bother asking?</b>

09:32.730 --> 09:33.900
<b>I'm leaving.</b>

09:33.900 --> 09:36.810
<b>Oh, wait a sec. 
Hina, what do you want for dinner?</b>

09:36.810 --> 09:38.260
<b>I saw some cabbage left over.</b>

09:38.590 --> 09:40.390
<b>That's my girl.</b>

10:14.780 --> 10:17.120
<b>See, all three of us have the same one.</b>

10:17.120 --> 10:19.230
<b>Sorry, I didn't bring mine.</b>

10:19.230 --> 10:21.740
<b>You sure are tactful.</b>

10:21.740 --> 10:22.720
<b>Shut up.</b>

10:23.400 --> 10:25.220
<b>That thing on the door, right?</b>

10:25.700 --> 10:28.120
<b>You could have brought it if you noticed.</b>

10:28.120 --> 10:30.020
<b>You make a fuss whenever I touch 
your stuff without asking.</b>

10:30.020 --> 10:31.810
<b>Wait, you went in?</b>

10:31.810 --> 10:35.260
<b>Who was it again that asked me to bring 
the reference book you left behind?</b>

10:37.280 --> 10:39.610
Exile and the Kingdom
Camus

11:25.670 --> 11:26.840
<b>So it was you.</b>

11:36.120 --> 11:37.000
<b>David.</b>

11:37.710 --> 11:38.510
<b>David?</b>

11:44.760 --> 11:46.260
<b>Hey, you. Here.</b>

11:46.900 --> 11:48.930
<b>Thank goodness, I thought you'd left already.</b>

11:49.570 --> 11:50.980
<b>Make sure your parents see this.</b>

11:57.240 --> 11:58.520
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:02.810 --> 12:05.180
<b>Such a pain, transferring schools.</b>

12:05.180 --> 12:06.340
<b>What year?</b>

12:06.340 --> 12:06.990
<b>Third.</b>

12:07.640 --> 12:08.910
<b>Same as me.</b>

12:08.910 --> 12:11.270
<b>Sounds tough, transferring in your third year.</b>

12:11.270 --> 12:12.060
<b>Your name?</b>

12:12.060 --> 12:12.710
<b>Hm?</b>

12:13.350 --> 12:13.960
<b>What's your name?</b>

12:15.320 --> 12:16.460
<b>Touko Fukami.</b>

12:18.420 --> 12:19.170
<b>Touko.</b>

12:19.610 --> 12:21.590
<i>He's calling me by my first name?</i>

12:22.320 --> 12:25.370
<b>I saw you at fireworks the other day.</b>

12:25.760 --> 12:27.180
<b>You were buying a bell.</b>

12:31.700 --> 12:32.930
<b>Wait, Jonathan!</b>

12:33.400 --> 12:34.340
<b>Jonathan?</b>

12:35.370 --> 12:36.740
<b>That's the chicken's name.</b>

12:36.740 --> 12:39.110
<b>And then there's Husserl, Confucius,</b>

12:39.110 --> 12:40.830
<b>Roger, and Makuzu.</b>

12:40.830 --> 12:43.020
<b>We're all taking care of them at school,</b>

12:43.020 --> 12:45.820
<b>but I think the ethics 
teacher puts in the most time.</b>

12:46.120 --> 12:48.870
<b>Jonathan's from somewhere else.</b>

12:49.850 --> 12:51.450
<b>So that's why it's not fitting in.</b>

12:54.050 --> 12:57.170
<b>They're free-range, so they're so hard to draw.</b>

12:57.170 --> 12:59.340
<b>You could just put them in a coop.</b>

13:00.970 --> 13:03.820
<b>I can't make that decision.</b>

13:03.820 --> 13:05.120
<b>It'd be cruel.</b>

13:05.120 --> 13:08.190
<b>Why isn't Jonathan running away? That's amazing.</b>

13:08.190 --> 13:09.300
<b>Cruel?</b>

13:09.700 --> 13:11.640
<b>It's better if they get to 
go wherever they want to.</b>

13:12.380 --> 13:14.020
<b>That's just your own point of view.</b>

13:14.270 --> 13:15.010
<b>Huh?</b>

13:15.310 --> 13:16.640
<b>Well...</b>

13:16.980 --> 13:19.480
<b>there aren't any animals that'd 
go into cages on their own.</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:23.400
<b>That's because they don't 
have enough options.</b>

13:23.400 --> 13:24.370
<b>Huh?</b>

13:25.260 --> 13:28.160
<b>This is a port town. 
There are lots of cats.</b>

13:28.950 --> 13:30.910
<b>Ever considered that they 
might get attacked?</b>

13:31.500 --> 13:34.000
<b>They're all full from eating fish!</b>

13:34.000 --> 13:35.080
<b>I think.</b>

13:35.080 --> 13:38.170
<b>I haven't heard about any of 
them getting attacked by cats.</b>

13:38.810 --> 13:40.130
<b>What about other than cats?</b>

13:40.630 --> 13:42.180
<b>Jonathan can fly awa—</b>

13:47.420 --> 13:48.280
<b>Huh?</b>

13:51.490 --> 13:52.380
<b>Run!</b>

13:59.210 --> 14:00.590
<b>What's wrong with you?</b>

14:00.890 --> 14:02.240
<b>I thought they could fly away.</b>

14:04.880 --> 14:06.900
<b>Am I friend or foe?</b>

14:09.660 --> 14:12.410
<b>Then I'll protect Jonathan!</b>

14:19.400 --> 14:21.550
<b>Okay? Please and thank you.</b>

14:21.550 --> 14:22.810
<b>I don't know...</b>

14:22.810 --> 14:24.130
<b>Please!</b>

14:26.980 --> 14:28.760
<b>Hello.</b>

14:29.070 --> 14:30.770
<b>How did I get dragged into this?</b>

14:30.770 --> 14:32.350
<b>Over here.</b>

14:32.350 --> 14:34.540
<b>I'll explain in detail tomorrow.</b>

14:34.990 --> 14:36.440
<b>Is Yana-chan okay with this?</b>

14:36.440 --> 14:39.400
<b>It'll be fine. She's not completely heartless.</b>

14:39.670 --> 14:42.730
<b>Thank you so much, Momo-san.</b>

14:42.730 --> 14:44.820
<b>No problem. Leave it to me.</b>

14:46.620 --> 14:47.150
<b>Hey.</b>

14:47.840 --> 14:49.760
<b>She just got her license.</b>

14:49.760 --> 14:51.660
<b>She can't wait to drive someone around.</b>

14:55.550 --> 14:56.750
<b>Tee hee.</b>

15:06.970 --> 15:10.590
<b>Good grief. I never signed up for this, either!</b>

15:11.510 --> 15:12.940
<b>Whoa!</b>

15:26.670 --> 15:29.350
<b>Hey! Why'd you put it in my room?</b>

15:29.350 --> 15:30.650
<b>I texted you.</b>

15:30.650 --> 15:33.200
<b>It might get attacked if it's outside.</b>

15:33.550 --> 15:35.980
<b>Keep the two of them in your room, then.</b>

15:35.980 --> 15:38.890
<b>And I told you I can't check 
my messages during lessons.</b>

15:38.890 --> 15:42.640
<b>Don't be so mean. They aren't 
in their familiar environment.</b>

15:44.100 --> 15:45.090
<b>By the way,</b>

15:45.480 --> 15:48.440
<b>you should learn how to count chickens.</b>

15:48.440 --> 15:50.490
<b>This is another favor for Touko, isn't it?</b>

15:51.820 --> 15:55.430
<b>You always do everything Touko asks you to.</b>

15:56.040 --> 15:57.100
<b>It's not like that.</b>

15:57.860 --> 15:59.400
<b>I haven't had ramune in forever.</b>

15:59.400 --> 16:00.320
<b>Open it.</b>

16:00.320 --> 16:02.730
<b>Do it yourself. Learn from Touko.</b>

16:02.730 --> 16:03.830
<b>Just do it.</b>

16:14.960 --> 16:15.770
<b>I've...</b>

16:16.740 --> 16:18.950
<b>always wanted chickens.</b>

16:19.530 --> 16:20.450
<b>Yuki,</b>

16:22.080 --> 16:24.920
<b>if Touko told you to die,</b>

16:25.450 --> 16:26.390
<b>would you?</b>

16:28.140 --> 16:30.920
<b>She... wouldn't say that.</b>

16:34.240 --> 16:37.300
<b>I know she wouldn't.</b>

17:09.440 --> 17:12.290
<b>I know! Let's have hot pot today.</b>

17:12.290 --> 17:14.510
<b>Hot pot in the summer. Perfect.</b>

17:24.980 --> 17:25.870
<b>Jonathan,</b>

17:26.450 --> 17:27.990
<b>are you happy right now?</b>

17:28.390 --> 17:29.740
<b>How do you want to live?</b>

17:30.370 --> 17:33.050
<b>Am I keeping you safe?</b>

17:48.020 --> 17:50.150
<b>Dinner, Onee-chan.</b>

17:51.300 --> 17:52.750
<b>O-Okay!</b>

17:56.850 --> 17:59.330
<b>It's mid-summer. Why chicken hot pot?</b>

17:59.330 --> 18:00.900
<b>Have you considered how hot it is?</b>

18:01.220 --> 18:03.380
<b>I just had a craving.</b>

18:04.360 --> 18:05.760
<b>It looks good.</b>

18:05.760 --> 18:07.230
<b>Come on, Touko.</b>

18:07.530 --> 18:09.090
<b>Let's eat!</b>

18:09.520 --> 18:13.150
<b>Why did you just randomly 
bring home a chicken?</b>

18:13.150 --> 18:14.680
<b>"Why"?</b>

18:15.070 --> 18:17.240
<b>Well, It was just impulse.</b>

18:17.240 --> 18:18.540
<b>I don't know if I should have.</b>

18:18.860 --> 18:20.750
<b>I got everyone involved, too.</b>

18:21.050 --> 18:24.430
<b>And it doesn't even solve the problem.</b>

18:24.810 --> 18:27.830
<b>There's no difference between putting 
him in a room and putting him in a coop.</b>

18:28.130 --> 18:30.960
<b>What does Jonathan even think of all this?</b>

18:31.390 --> 18:34.650
<b>Ah, I guess I fooled myself into</b>

18:34.650 --> 18:37.990
<b>thinking I knew what Jonathan wanted.</b>

18:37.990 --> 18:40.410
<b>We got some good chicken today.</b>

18:40.410 --> 18:40.970
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:46.890 --> 18:50.890
<b>Speaking of chicken, I remember 
my first date with Ken-chan.</b>

18:50.890 --> 18:51.940
<b>What happened?</b>

18:51.940 --> 18:55.090
<b>It was our first date, and he was <i>late</i>.</b>

18:55.450 --> 18:58.380
<b>You were the late one. Two hours late.</b>

18:58.380 --> 19:02.600
<b>Huh? I asked you if you waited, 
and you said "I just got here."</b>

19:02.600 --> 19:04.120
<b>W-Well, you know...</b>

19:04.800 --> 19:06.990
<b>So what does that have 
to do with chickens?</b>

19:06.990 --> 19:09.740
<b>Well, I got caught up copying a</b>

19:09.740 --> 19:12.450
<b>Jakuchuu chicken painting.</b>

19:12.450 --> 19:15.560
<b>Why would you paint a chicken 
before your first date?</b>

19:15.560 --> 19:17.230
<b>Aren't there more important things to do?</b>

19:17.230 --> 19:18.600
<b>It's your first, after all.</b>

19:19.370 --> 19:20.980
<b>You're so naive, Hina.</b>

19:21.480 --> 19:25.240
<b>So you're less interested in 
Dad than you are in chickens?</b>

19:26.160 --> 19:26.890
<b>Oh, my.</b>

19:39.910 --> 19:42.060
<b>Let's go somewhere Sachi 
can go next time.</b>

19:42.060 --> 19:42.890
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:42.890 --> 19:45.030
<b>We went hiking together 
last year, didn't we?</b>

19:45.280 --> 19:46.370
<b>Yeah?</b>

19:46.600 --> 19:47.350
<b>Okay.</b>

19:47.350 --> 19:50.800
<b>We can't let the festival end just yet.</b>

19:50.800 --> 19:52.240
<b>That again.</b>

19:51.340 --> 19:53.200
<b>Thank you for waiting.</b>

19:53.940 --> 19:56.990
<b>It's a bit late to get 
ready now, so, tomorrow?</b>

19:56.990 --> 19:59.020
<b>You're always so spontaneous.</b>

20:01.470 --> 20:04.360
<b>I'm never taking care of chickens again.</b>

20:04.360 --> 20:05.610
<b>Never, ever.</b>

20:05.610 --> 20:06.880
<b>Seriously, you're unbelievable.</b>

20:06.880 --> 20:07.750
<b>Sorry.</b>

20:07.750 --> 20:09.110
<b>They were cute, weren't they?</b>

20:09.110 --> 20:10.870
<b>A giant tanuki might have gotten</b>

20:10.870 --> 20:13.310
<b>them if we hadn't taken them in.</b>

20:13.310 --> 20:15.920
<b>What? Where the heck do 
giant tanuki even live?</b>

20:15.920 --> 20:17.480
<b>Touché.</b>

20:17.480 --> 20:20.290
<b>It's because Yuki let them in 
my room in the first place.</b>

20:20.290 --> 20:22.910
<b>Come on, you don't even 
know how to count them.</b>

20:22.910 --> 20:24.140
<b>I do, too.</b>

20:24.140 --> 20:24.700
<b>Tell me, then.</b>

20:25.410 --> 20:26.620
<b>Welcome!</b>

20:26.880 --> 20:29.620
<b>Chickens really do crow in the morning, huh?</b>

20:32.770 --> 20:34.770
<b>They didn't lay any eggs.</b>

20:36.170 --> 20:39.430
<b>I wonder if zoo animals are happy.</b>

20:39.430 --> 20:40.150
<b>So,</b>

20:41.260 --> 20:43.720
<b>what made you decide to take them in?</b>

20:46.950 --> 20:49.340
<b>Um... A transfer student...</b>

20:49.340 --> 20:51.930
<b>He's a third year, and looks like David...</b>

20:53.880 --> 20:54.860
<b>You mean me?</b>

21:00.490 --> 21:02.620
<i>What a surprise.</i>

21:03.840 --> 21:05.360
<b>I'll introduce him.</b>

21:05.360 --> 21:07.450
<b>Um, his name is...</b>

21:07.450 --> 21:08.410
<b>Okikura.</b>

21:09.040 --> 21:10.660
<b>David Okikura?</b>

21:17.910 --> 21:21.250
<b>I thought I was doing the 
right thing for Jonathan...</b>

21:21.250 --> 21:23.100
<b>And who are you, exactly?</b>

21:24.370 --> 21:27.120
<b>I figured there'd be guys, but...</b>

21:27.120 --> 21:28.230
<b>What's with you?</b>

21:44.160 --> 21:46.730
<b>Touko, I saw</b>

21:47.070 --> 21:48.810
<b>what you saw that day.</b>

23:30.050 --> 23:31.930
<b>I think I'll ask him out.</b>

23:31.930 --> 23:33.390
<b>He didn't pull anything weird, did he?</b>

23:33.390 --> 23:34.240
<b>He did?</b>

23:34.240 --> 23:34.890
<b>What?</b>

23:34.890 --> 23:36.850
<b>What do you mean?</b>

23:36.850 --> 23:39.030
<b>Be open to love!</b>

23:37.350 --> 23:39.350
<b>Episode 2
"Bench"</b>

23:39.350 --> 23:41.350
<b></b>
